            "content": "课程编号 0701000215",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.198,
                0.881,
                0.217
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "专业____本部电气、物电等____层次（本、专）____本____考试方式（开、闭卷）____闭卷",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.24,
                0.58,
                0.257
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "一、选择题(本大题总分20分，共计5小题，每题4分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.266,
                0.671,
                0.335
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 以点 \\(A(1,1,1)\\) 、 \\(B(5,2,0)\\) 、 \\(C(2,5,0)\\) 、 \\(D(1,2,4)\\) 为顶点的四面体体积为（）.\nA. 12 B. 8\nC. 4 D. 3",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.344,
                0.589,
                0.464
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2.使 \\( x^{2}\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}+y^{2}\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=2z \\) 成立的是（）.\nA.  \\( z=e^{\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}} \\) \nB.  \\( z=e^{-\\left(\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}\\right)} \\) \nC.  \\( z = e^{\\frac{1}{x}} \\) \nD.  \\( z = e^{\\frac{1}{y}} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.477,
                0.719,
                0.563
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3.设D是由 \\( x=y^{2} \\) ， \\( x=-y^{2} \\) ，y=1所围成的闭区域，则 \\( \\iint_{D}x\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}d\\sigma=(\\quad) \\) .\nA. 0\nB. 4\nC. -1\nD. 1",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.572,
                0.752,
                0.686
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 设  \\( \\Sigma \\)  为平面 x = a, y = a,  \\( z = a (a > 0) \\)  及三个坐标面所围成的立体的表面的外侧，则\n \\( \\oint_{\\Sigma}(y^{2}z-x)\\mathrm{d}y\\mathrm{d}z+(z^{2}x-y)\\mathrm{d}z\\mathrm{d}x+(x^{2}y-z)\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y() \\) \nA.  \\( a^{3} \\)  B.  \\( -a^{3} \\) \nC.  \\( 3a^{3} \\)  D.  \\( -3a^{3} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.696,
                0.635,
                0.851
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5.若 \\(\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}u_n\\) 收敛，则（）.A. \\(\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}|u_n|\\) 收敛 B. \\(\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}u_{n}\\) 收敛C. \\(\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}u_nu_{n + 1}\\) 收敛 D. \\(\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}\\frac{u_n + u_{n + 1}}{2}\\) 收敛",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "bbox": [
                0.4,
                0.877,
                0.555,
                0.893
            ],
