    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.099,
                0.58,
                0.117
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题(本大题总分20分，共计5小题，每题4分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.127,
                0.912,
                0.173
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 设函数 \\( F(u, v) \\) 具有一阶连续偏导数，\\( F_u(0, 1) = 2 \\)，\\( F_v(0, 1) = -3 \\)，则曲面 \\( F(x - y + z, xy - yz + zx) = 0 \\) 在点 \\( (2, 1, -1) \\) 处的切平面方程为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.19,
                0.483,
                0.229
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 设函数 \\( f(x, y, z) = \\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{z}} \\)，则 \\( df|_{(1,1,1)} = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.245,
                0.66,
                0.283
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 将二次积分  \\( \\int_{0}^{1} dx \\int_{x}^{\\sqrt{x}} f(x, y) dy \\)  化为极坐标形式的二次积分为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.291,
                0.914,
                0.346
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 设  \\( \\Omega \\)  是由 xy = z,  \\( x + y = 1 \\) , z = 0 所围成的闭区域, 则把三重积分  \\( \\iiint_{\\Omega} f(x, y, z) \\, dv \\)  化成积分次序为  \\( z \\to y \\to x \\)  的三次积分为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.364,
                0.531,
                0.381
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5.将函数 \\( f(x)=\\ln(2+3x) \\) 展开成x的幂级数为____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.395,
                0.589,
                0.412
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、计算题(本大题总分50分，共计5小题，每题10分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.425,
                0.302,
                0.456
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 设 \\(e^z - xyz = 0\\)，求 \\(\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}, \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.501,
                0.426,
                0.517
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 求函数 \\( f(x, y) = (6x - x^2)(4y - y^2) \\) 的极值.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.558,
                0.836,
                0.596
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 计算  \\( \\int_{L}(x^{2}-y)dx-(x+\\sin^{2}y)dy \\) ，其中 L 是在圆周  \\( y=\\sqrt{2x-x^{2}} \\)  上由点  \\( (0,0) \\)  到点  \\( (1,1) \\)  的一段弧.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.642,
                0.661,
                0.681
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 计算 \\(\\iint_{\\Sigma} \\left(2x + \\frac{4}{3}y + z\\right) \\mathrm{d}S\\)，其中 \\(\\Sigma\\) 为平面 \\(\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{y}{3} + \\frac{z}{4} = 1\\) 在第一卦限的部分.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.709,
                0.323,
                0.752
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5.求级数 \\(\\sum_{n = 2}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}\\frac{n^{2} - n}{2^{n}}\\) 的和.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.762,
                0.417,
                0.779
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "四、证明题(本题10分，共计1小题)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.298,
                0.793,
                0.701,
                0.837
